===Etymology 1===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:code<id:laws>|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|code|id=system of law|t=system of law}}, from {{der|en|fro|code||system of law}}, from {{der|en|la|cōdex}}, later form of {{m|la|caudex||the stock or stem of a tree, a board or tablet of wood smeared over with wax, on which the ancients originally wrote; hence, a book, a writing.}}. {{doublet|en|codex}}.

Verb {{senseno|en|to suffer medical emergency}} is an {{ellipsis|en|code blue|t=medical emergency|nocap=1}}.

